@startuml
title Components in one repository - parts
package "component-slices" as Slices {
  interface "## Components in .prism/workflow.md" as Declaration
  interface "component of a file" as FileComponent
  interface "slice component in get_initiative" as SliceComponent
}
package "component-indexes" as Indexes
Indexes ..> Declaration : reads the declared components
Indexes ..> FileComponent : keys each index by component
Indexes ..> SliceComponent : may scope a slice's evidence
Indexes ..> Slices : designed and built after
@enduml
